    {
      "text": "Messiah … should rise from the dead, 1 Ne. 10:11 (2 Ne. 2:8). if the flesh should rise no more, 2 Ne. 9:8. he shall rise from the dead, 2 Ne. 25:13 (Alma 33:22; Hel. 14:20). after the Messiah hath risen from the dead … Jerusalem shall be destroyed, 2 Ne. 25:14. after Christ shall have risen … he shall show himself unto you, 2 Ne. 26:1. day cometh that all shall rise from the dead, Alma 11:41. when thou risest in the morning let thy heart be full of thanks, Alma 37:37. leaders of churches … shall rise in the pride of their hearts, Morm. 8:28.",
